# Observability Component

Prometheus metrics server lifecycle management with singleton pattern for centralized monitoring.

## Key Integration Pattern
- Single metrics server instance shared across all services via sync.Once
- Graceful shutdown with context-aware cleanup
- Thread-safe metric registration using prometheus.MustRegister

## Important Constraints
- Server must be started before any metrics are exposed
- Only one metrics server per application instance
- Collectors must be registered before server starts